{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人楊偉倫、鍾雪瑩、甄玉如及導演楊兩全下午（14日）現身旺角街頭，向市民派發星洲炒米和乾炒牛河，為主演電影《善男信女》宣傳，同場宣布電影累積票房已衝過5百萬大關，吸引大批市民圍觀。</p><p>談到票房表現理想，鍾雪瑩表示只是剛開始：「一千萬應該唔難！</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T12:25:18.714202+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T11:49:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T12:18:07.221761+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T12:18:07.221761+00:00","content_hash":"ad431f1ecfd6440b8b9c055c54a6ed87cd22ae749645aae5daba746a76bf696c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}